graph TD
    A[检验录入 addInspection] --> B[写入检验记录和检验值]
    B --> C[JudgmentEngine.judge]
    C --> D[findCandidateStandards]
    D --> E[SQL查询已发布候选标准]
    E --> F[detectCandidateConflicts]
    F --> G[同优先级标准两两比对规则]
    G --> H[StandardCompareUtils.compareRules]
    H --> I{是否阻断冲突}
    I -->|是| J[返回 STANDARD_CONFLICT]
    I -->|否| K[judgeAgainstStandard 指标比对]
    J --> L[saveJudgmentResult]
    K --> L
    L --> M[旧判定 is_final 置0]
    M --> N[插入新判定和证据快照]
    N --> O{是否有冲突项}
    O -->|是| P[写入 standard_conflict]
    O -->|否| Q[结束]
    P --> Q
